%% ============================================================
%% 1. USER REGISTRATION & VERIFICATION
%% ============================================================
graph TD
    Start1([User Memulai Registrasi]) --> InputCred1[Input Email/Phone & Password]
    InputCred1 --> ValidateCred1{Validasi<br/>Kredensial}
    
    ValidateCred1 -->|Invalid| ErrorCred1[Error: Password min 12 char<br/>atau Email/Phone invalid]
    ErrorCred1 --> InputCred1
    
    ValidateCred1 -->|Valid| CreateUser1[Create User<br/>Status: PENDING]
    CreateUser1 --> GenToken1[Generate Verification Token<br/>Store Hash Only]
    GenToken1 --> SendVerif1[Kirim Email/SMS Verifikasi]
    SendVerif1 --> WaitVerif1[User Klik Link Verifikasi]
    
    WaitVerif1 --> ValidateToken1{Token Valid<br/>& Belum Expired?}
    ValidateToken1 -->|No| ErrorToken1[Error: Token Invalid/Expired]
    ErrorToken1 --> End1([End])
    
    ValidateToken1 -->|Yes| ConsumeToken1[Consume Token<br/>One-time Use]
    ConsumeToken1 --> ActivateUser1[Update User Status: ACTIVE<br/>Set verified_at]
    ActivateUser1 --> End1Success([User Aktif<br/>Bisa Login])
